---
// About Lab Name. The title, headings, order and step format follow the about-page skill
// (.agents/skills/about-page/SKILL.md): plain words that are the same on every lab. The
// look can follow the lab's theme; the words never do. Leave out sections that don't
// apply rather than filling them. Numbers and dates come from the lab's data at build
// time, never typed in.
import LabLayout from 'kp-design/layouts/LabLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/theme.css';

// "How it works": in the order things happen, from the source to the visitor's screen.
// Each step's name is a plain sentence about what happens, never a play on the theme.
const steps = [
  {
    name: 'The site is built from this repo',
    where: 'Cloudflare, whenever something changes',
    body: ['Replace these steps with how this lab really works: where its data starts, what happens to it, and what your browser does.'],
  },
  {
    name: 'Your browser shows the page',
    where: 'Your phone or computer',
    body: ['The page is plain files. There’s no account and nothing you do is saved.'],
  },
];
---

<LabLayout
  title="About Lab Name"
  description="What Lab Name is, how it works and what it collects."
  image="/lab-slug/og-about.png"
  imageAlt="About Lab Name: what it is and how it works, on kylepace.dev."
>
  <a slot="bar" class="bar-link" href="/lab-slug/">Lab Name</a>

  <article class="lab-page about-page prose">
    <h1 class="title">About Lab Name</h1>

    <section aria-labelledby="what-title">
      <h2 id="what-title">What it is</h2>
      <p>One or two short paragraphs: what <a href="/lab-slug/">Lab Name</a> does and who it’s for.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="how-title">
      <h2 id="how-title">How it works</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        {
          steps.map((step) => (
            <li>
              <h3>{step.name}</h3>
              <p class="where">Where it runs: {step.where}.</p>
              {step.body.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="good-title">
      <h2 id="good-title">Good to know</h2>
      <p>Limits and accuracy: how old the data can be, what’s missing, what it’s not for.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
      <h2 id="privacy-title">Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Analytics works the same as the rest of kylepace.dev: anonymous, no cookies, and you can turn it off (<a
          href="https://kylepace.dev/privacy/">privacy</a
        >). This lab doesn’t contact any other sites.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <h2 id="contact-title">Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        Questions or something that looks wrong: email <a href="mailto:mail@kylepace.net">mail@kylepace.net</a>. The code is public:{' '}
        <a href="https://github.com/kyle-pace/lab-slug">github.com/kyle-pace/lab-slug</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</LabLayout>
